    {
      "id": "note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "# \ud83e\udde0 Query power\n\nThree live SPARQL queries, three engines \u2014 no backend, straight from your browser:\n\n- **Collection depth** (WDQS) \u2014 how many Wikidata items link to major museums' collections\n- **Women in Red** (Humaniki) \u2014 % of English Wikipedia biographies about women\n- **Most-depicted subjects** (QLever) \u2014 the top topics in Commons' structured data\n\nEdit any card's \u2699 to change the query, endpoint, or renderer.",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "depth",
      "widgetType": "sparql",
      "config": {
        "preset": "met-collection",
        "query": "",
        "endpoint": "wdqs",
        "renderer": "auto",
        "maxRows": 100,
        "refreshSeconds": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "women",
      "widgetType": "sparql",
      "config": {
        "preset": "women-in-red",
        "query": "",
        "endpoint": "humaniki",
        "renderer": "auto",
        "maxRows": 100,
        "refreshSeconds": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "depicts",
